262
00:12:54,001 --> 00:12:56,221
JESSA: Selamat malam.
PACAR: Selamat malam, baba.

263
00:12:57,526 --> 00:12:58,658
JUSTIN: Oke,
aku akan melompat ke lonjakan

264
00:12:58,701 --> 00:12:59,964
