404
00:18:40,521 --> 00:18:41,566
Uh, Evy.

405
00:18:42,262 --> 00:18:44,264
"Mike membunuh semua."

406
00:18:45,700 --> 00:18:48,268
Um... Ya,
bisa kita istirahat sebentar?

407
00:18:48,312 --> 00:18:51,184
Apa? Ya, tentu.
Maksudku... ya, tidak.

408
00:18:51,228 --> 00:18:53,099
Jam berapa sekarang?
Haruskah kita sudahi malam ini?

409
00:18:53,143 --> 00:18:54,753
Um, lanjut besok?

410
00:18:54,796 --> 00:18:57,016
-Kau baik-baik saja?
-Ya, ya, ya, aku baik.

411
00:18:57,059 --> 00:18:59,975
Oh, tunggu. Sebenarnya,
